            "review_title": "Review at Ippudo Ramen Le Thanh Ton - Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "HaijoLee\nStavanger, Norway719 contributions\n0\nFound this place by accident. Will come back! Amazing ramen and good service.\nSep 2025 • Friends\nI love japanese food and just happened to walk past this place after gym one day and decided to stop by. \nOne of the best ramens I’ve had in my life. \nYou can feel the richness of the broth in every spoon.\nThe texture of the noodles, the rich aroma and taste in every single bite. The meat and egg was perfect. \nI was so happy that the next day I came back with 3 more friends. \n10/10 food 10/10 service. All the staff is greeting you welcome and goodbye when leaving. \nWill definitely come back here next year in 2026 :)\nRead more\nWritten September 26, 2025",
