            "review_title": "Review at Ippudo Ramen Le Thanh Ton - Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "tenzing s\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam13 contributions\n0\nSpicy black\nMar 2025 • Couples\nOne of the best Japanese noodle.... Slow cooked, cleanly serving, very polite staff and great service...one of the fastest serving Japanese food restaurant in Saigon....must try is naban, buns, etc\nWritten March 16, 2025\nPizza 4P's Guest Service\nDear Mr./Ms. Tenzing S,\n\nThank you sincerely for your kind words and for taking the time to share your experience at Ippudo Le Thanh Ton.\n\nWe’re truly delighted to know you enjoyed our Spicy Black ramen, as well as other dishes like the Naban and buns. Your compliments on the quality of our food, the politeness of our staff, and the speed of service are deeply appreciated.\n\nYour feedback is not only encouraging but also a wonderful reminder of why we’re passionate about delivering authentic Japanese ramen with heartfelt hospitality.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back soon for another satisfying visit.\nWishing you a wonderful day!\nWarm regards,\nIppudo's Team\nRead more\nWritten May 17, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
