            "review_text": "Freya B\nBath, United Kingdom43 contributions\n0\nSeriously good ramen!\nJun 2024 • Family\nHad delicious tonkotsu ramen with my mum I had seen the menu from outside. They have upstairs seating too and the food took 5 minutes to come out. Super fast food and I had a delicious mojito ale to accompany my meal. Absolutely insane broth flavour and I would love to go again. Can choose the saltiness of the broth and how hard you want your noodles. Amazing!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 29, 2024\nPizza 4P's Guest Service\nDear Mr./Ms. Freyab292,\n\nThank you so much for your wonderful review of Ippudo Le Thanh Ton! We’re thrilled to hear that you and your mum enjoyed the tonkotsu ramen and that you appreciated the quick service, the option to customize your broth and noodles, and of course, the incredible flavor of our broth.\n\nWe’re also glad to know the Mojito Ale was a great pairing for your meal!\n\nYour kind words mean a lot to our team, and we can’t wait to welcome you back for another delicious bowl of ramen soon.\n\nWarm regards,\nIppudo's Team\nRead more\nWritten May 17, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
